  <h1>About MyTarotTales</h1>
  <p>Welcome to MyTarotTales, the premier online platform for <em>tarot journaling</em>, <em>spiritual self-reflection</em>, and <em>mystical journaling prompts</em>. Whether you’re a seasoned tarot practitioner or just beginning your spiritual journey, MyTarotTales empowers you to deepen your intuition, cultivate mindfulness, and document your personal growth through the power of tarot.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>What Is Tarot Journaling?</h2>
    <p>Tarot journaling combines the ancient wisdom of tarot cards with the therapeutic practice of reflective writing. Each card draw becomes a prompt for self discovery, emotional healing, and mindful introspection. By capturing your insights, intentions, and revelations, you build a record of your spiritual evolution.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How Card Draws Work</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Draw a Tarot Card:</strong> If you want a prompt to help you journal, the system randomly selects a tarot card. Each card offers a unique symbolic meaning.</li>
      <li><strong>Receive Journaling Prompts:</strong> Our tarot guide crafts journaling prompts tailored to your card’s symbolism and orientation.</li>
      <li><strong>Reflect & Record:</strong> Write down your thoughts, emotions, and insights in your private tarot diary to track progress over time.</li>
      <li><strong>Analyze & Grow:</strong> Filter and review entries by date, card, or theme to gain clarity and foster your spiritual growth.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Key Features</h2>
